a de seguros): abre o lote dia 20" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#B45309;fontColor=#3B2200;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="808" y="253" width="175" height="71" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" value="Operador Seguros: negocia e usa o agente" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#B45309;fontColor=#3B2200;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1968" y="256" width="175" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" value="Fluid: instâncias RPA | Baixa de Apólices, Cotação, Aviso de Renovação, Assinaturas e Emissão de Apólices" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#0369A1;fontColor=#0C2A40;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1098" y="361" width="175" height="101" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" value="Robôs UiPath: alimentador, baixa da apólice, dados do ano passado e cotação" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#0369A1;fontColor=#0C2A40;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1388" y="498" width="175" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" value="UiPath Orchestrator: filas Auto, Residencial e Questionário" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;size=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#CCFBF1;strokeColor=#0F766E;fontColor=#042F2E;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1670" y="506" width="190" height="71" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" value="Portais das 5 seguradoras (acesso por tela)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E2E8F0;strokeColor=#475569;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1098" y="622" width="175" height="71" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" value="Sistema de cotação (acesso por tela, 90+ seletores)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E2E8F0;strokeColor=#475569;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1678" y="622" width="175" height="71" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" value="Vistoria (a recusa chega por e-mail)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E2E8F0;strokeColor=#475569;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="518" y="625" width="175" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" value="Pasta de rede (UNC): PDF das apólices" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#15803D;fontColor=#052E16;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1098" y="741" width="175" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" value="Agente de IA: lê os PDFs e monta o questionário de 15 perguntas" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#0369A1;fontColor=#0C2A40;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2258" y="730" width="175" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" value="Teams: o operador chama o agente" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E2E8F0;strokeColor=#475569;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1678" y="863" width="175" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n35" value="WhatsApp: aviso de renovação, negociação e contrato com o cliente" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E2E8F0;strokeColor=#475569;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2258" y="852" width="175" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n36" value="E-mail: recusa da vistoria" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E2E8F0;strokeColor=#475569;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80